There are many different stage types to choose from. This defines stages of a quest and is where you will plan out quest objectives like mining blocks, killing mobs, etc.

You have the option of creating multiple stages within one quest (Ex. Stage 1 Talk to NPC, Stage 2 Go Fish, Stage 3 Go back and talk to NPC for reward)

Within each stage you can set:
1. Blocks
- Break Blocks
- Damage Blocks
- Place Blocks
- Use Blocks

Within each Blocks you pick 1 the Block Name. 2 Block Amount. 3 Block Durabilities

2. Items
- Craft
- Smelt
- Enchant
- Brew
- Consume

3. NPCs (Requires Citizens Plugin)
- Deliver Items (to npc)
- Talk To NPC
- Kill NPC

4. Mobs
- Kill mobs
- Tame mobs
- Catch Fish
- Milke Cows
- Shear Sheep

5. Kill Players
- Amount of Players to Kill

6. Reach Locations
- Set Locations
- Set Location Radii
- Set Location Names

7. Password
- Add Password Hints
- Add Password Phrase

8. Custom Objectives (Modules Required)
- Mythic Mobs Custom Objectives
- Interactions Custom Objectives

(Note: Custom Objectives still needs better documentation if you are familiar)
